from m6-event-shaymin-caught.replay
# Event branch m6-event-gracidea (decomp Pokemon_CanShayminSkyForm, Party_SetShayminForm):
# Shaymin's Sky Forme. Staged in Floaroma by the Beauty, the fateful Shaymin of m6-event-shaymin-caught in the party
# (find_party_slot_with_fateful_encounter_species): she gives the Gracidea. From the bag at noon, USE on Shaymin: the form
# change, Sky Forme (its ability Serene Grace, its stats). Then the clock moves on to 21:00: the night turns it back to
# Land Forme (the game clock's minutes, decomp sub_02055B64). The Gracidea stays in the bag.
# Kept setup: the clock to noon (the chain's frozen clock has stood at 20:00 since cp21e) and the warp to Floaroma.
time 12:00
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_FLOAROMA_TOWN 171 659 left
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
until idle 600
+0 assert state bag.key_items[item="platinum:ITEM_GRACIDEA"].count 1
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:2
+1 assert app bag
+1 tap pocket:7
+1 tap row:12
+1 tap menu:0
+1 assert app party
+1 tap slot:5
+1 assert state party[5].form 1
+0 assert state party[5].ability "platinum:ABILITY_SERENE_GRACE"
+30 press a
+1 release a
+30 press b
+1 release b
+30 press b
+1 release b
+30 press b
+1 release b
until app none 600
until idle 600
+0 assert state party[5].form 1
+0 assert state bag.key_items[item="platinum:ITEM_GRACIDEA"].count 1
+0 time 21:00
+5 assert state party[5].form 0
+0 assert state party[5].ability "platinum:ABILITY_NATURAL_CURE"
